    <record id="view_coffee_help_faq" model="ir.ui.view">
      <field name="name">coffee.help.faq.form</field>
      <field name="model">coffee.help</field>
      <field name="arch" type="xml">
        <form string="Coffee Outlet Module FAQ" create="false" edit="false" delete="false" nolabel="1">
          <sheet>
            <h2 style="color:#673AB7; font-weight:bold; font-size:28px; margin-bottom:15px; border-bottom:2px solid #673AB7; padding-bottom:8px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#2C3E50;">
              <ul>
                
                <li><b>Q:</b> How do I create a new coffee outlet?<br/><b>A:</b> Go to Outlets → New, fill in the details, select the owning Customer, and save. A CRM opportunity will be automatically generated.</li>
                <li><b>Q:</b> How are CRM opportunities generated?<br/><b>A:</b> Whenever you create a new outlet, the system automatically creates a linked CRM lead for follow-up.</li>
                <li><b>Q:</b> How can I link multiple outlets to a single customer?<br/><b>A:</b> Select the same Customer for all outlets that belong to that organization.</li>
                <li><b>Q:</b> Can I edit the CRM opportunity after the outlet is created?<br/><b>A:</b> Yes, the linked CRM lead can be updated in the CRM module just like any other opportunity.</li>
                <li><b>Q:</b> What happens if I update the outlet information?<br/><b>A:</b> The changes are saved in the outlet record; the linked CRM lead remains associated but won’t automatically update unless manually modified.</li>
                <li><b>Q:</b> Can I create an outlet without specifying the manager?<br/><b>A:</b> Yes, but it is recommended to fill in the manager and regional manager fields for proper tracking and accountability.</li>


              </ul>
            </div>
          </sheet>
        </form>
      </field>
    </record>

